WEBVTT

NOTE Transcribed and translated in Translator (first 30s). Not YouTube automatic captions.

00:00:00.119 --> 00:00:06.219
For 'One Fine Spring Day,' maybe twenty percent of the lines were scripted, and about eighty percent of the dialogue was made up on set.

00:00:06.219 --> 00:00:08.477
Does drinking alcohol actually help when you're acting?

00:00:08.477 --> 00:00:13.739
Director Song said, "Drink only up to the point where it helps."

00:00:13.739 --> 00:00:20.518
When you are shooting a love scene, I believe that at least in that moment you really have to love sincerely.

00:00:20.518 --> 00:00:23.457
With Lee Woo-jin in 'Oldboy,' I thought, "The way I created him is the best."

00:00:23.457 --> 00:00:25.018
There are some difficult parts.

00:00:25.018 --> 00:00:29.000
When I said it like this, they told me, "It'll be fine."

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:30.000
This is what he said to me.
